"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"共公","kind":"person","person_id":"vs4_n7e_1qh_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"pft_5o1_zzt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m055-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"重耳","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p067","text":"五年春，晉文公欲伐曹，假道於衞，衞人弗許。還自河南度，侵曹，伐衞。正月，取五鹿。二月，晉侯、齊侯盟于斂盂。衞侯請盟晉，晉人不許。衞侯欲與楚，國人不欲，故出其君以説晉。衞侯居襄牛，公子買守衞。楚救衞，不卒。晉侯圍曹。三月丙午，晉師入曹，數之以其不用釐負羈言，而用美女乘軒者三百人也。令軍毋入僖負羈宗家以報德。楚圍宋，宋復告急晉。文公欲救則攻楚，爲楚嘗有德，不欲伐也；欲釋宋，宋又嘗有德於晉：患之。先軫曰：「執曹伯，分曹、衞地以與宋，楚急曹、衞，其勢宜釋宋。」於是文公從之，而楚成王乃引兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"晉侯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"齊侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m067-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"衞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"i8i_rvh_4lp_A","status":"con